@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title Stack-safe PropertyValue: logical tree, flat ownership, bounded persistence

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #495057
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

component "caller API\nInt · String · List · Null" as API #DBE4FF
component "node tape N\npostorder scalar/list records" as NODES #C3FAE8
component "edge tape E\nordered child-root indices" as EDGES #D3F9D8
component "borrowed logical view\nPropertyValueKind\nPropertyList cursor" as VIEW #E5DBFF
component "explicit machines\nequality · debug · validation" as PDA #FFF3BF
component "CPV1 encoder\nmagic · count · tagged nodes" as ENCODE #C5F6FA
component "bounded CPV1 decoder\nbyte cursor · bottom-up arena" as DECODE #FFD8A8
component "Serde carrier\nserialize_bytes / bounded visitor" as SERDE #FCC2D7
component "typed rejection\nnode · edge · string · byte · work" as ERROR #FFE3E3

API --> NODES : constructors append nodes
API --> EDGES : lists append child roots
NODES --> VIEW
EDGES --> VIEW
VIEW --> PDA : counted cursor frames
NODES --> ENCODE
EDGES --> ENCODE
ENCODE --> SERDE : canonical CPV1 bytes
SERDE --> DECODE
DECODE --> NODES : validated postorder
DECODE --> EDGES : validated ranges/order
PDA --> ERROR : invariant/cap failure
DECODE --> ERROR : malformed/cap failure

note bottom of NODES
  Every child node precedes its parent.
  A non-null root is the final node.
  Standalone Null is the empty canonical arena.
end note

note bottom of EDGES
  Each List stores one checked range in E.
  Ranges partition E in node order.
  Every non-root node has exactly one parent.
end note

note bottom of PDA
  Native call depth is constant in logical depth.
  Counted list cursors retain O(depth) live obligations,
  while N and E retain O(nodes + edges) owned data.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#DBE4FF>| source-compatible construction API |
|<#C3FAE8>| flat node ownership |
|<#D3F9D8>| flat ordered-edge ownership |
|<#E5DBFF>| logical borrowed projection |
|<#FFF3BF>| explicit pushdown/cursor machines |
|<#C5F6FA>| canonical encoder |
|<#FFD8A8>| bounded decoder |
|<#FCC2D7>| format-neutral Serde carrier |
|<#FFE3E3>| explicit rejection |
endlegend
@enduml
